# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Local session state and site configuration. The site registry lives outside
# the repo by design (see docs/site-config.md) -- if one ever appears in here,
# it is a mistake, and a mistake that may carry a token.
/.reaper-state/
*.local
*.local.*
reaper.toml
token
token.*

# Results, on their way back from a session. reaper is a tenant of itself, so
# this directory is real here rather than hypothetical: it is where a run's
# traces and artifacts land, and none of it is source.
/out/

# Editor and OS droppings
*~
.#*
\#*#
.DS_Store

# A CARGO_HOME that .github/workflows/release.yml puts inside the workspace,
# because for one of the build jobs the workspace is the only thing that
# crosses into the machine doing the build, and so the only thing a cache can
# reach. See that file for which and why -- naming it here would be an
# operating system in a place the guest seam does not allow one, and the guard
# is right about that. Never present on a workstation.
/.cargo-home/
